# --- Claude / local tooling ---
# Published (David's call, 2026-07-05): the skill library, CLAUDE.md (North Star guardrails),
# PROTOCOL.md, and the hook scripts — so clones/worktrees carry the full anti-drift surface.
# Still local-only: settings.local.json (machine-specific, permission history), agents/, worktrees/.
# Use /* (contents) not / (the dir) so the negations can re-include; negations LAST so they win;
# .CLAUDE/* covers the case-sensitive-FS variant (Linux) harmlessly on Windows.
.claude/*
.CLAUDE/*
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/PROTOCOL.md
!.claude/hooks/

# --- Project governance docs (excluded from the public repo per request) ---
CONTRACT.md

# --- ROMs: copyrighted. NEVER publish a ROM. ---
*.gb
*.gbc
*.gba
*.sgb
*.rom
roms/*.gb
roms/*.gbc
roms/*.gba

# --- Emulator save data / generated run artifacts ---
runs/
# per-iteration aria memory snapshots (zipped before each wipe; binary, not for the repo)
aria_memory_archives/
*.sav
*.state
*.sa1
# generated: rendered from the aria game constitution
red_system_prompt.txt
# generated: ViZDoom runtime config written to the working dir
_vizdoom.ini
_vizdoom/

# --- Model weights / downloads: large binaries, regenerable, NEVER commit ---
weights/
*.pt
*.onnx
*.safetensors
# isolated probe envs (torch/clip/yolo) — multi-hundred-MB, regenerable
.venv-probe*/

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.venv/
venv/
env/
*.log
